msgid "The default locale directory is system dependent; for example, on Red Hat Linux it is :file:`/usr/share/locale`, but on Solaris it is :file:`/usr/lib/locale`. The :mod:`!gettext` module does not try to support these system dependent defaults; instead its default is :file:`{sys.base_prefix}/share/locale` (see :data:`sys.base_prefix`). For this reason, it is always best to call :func:`bindtextdomain` with an explicit absolute path at the start of your application."
